author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: Bun init and merge install pass strict health on a fresh Git workspace; Repeated install is idempotent and a real two-branch merge executes the driver
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: high
confidence: 85
severity: high
resolution: Merge installation now selects a version-matched stable absolute Bun launcher and driver audit accepts valid Node or Bun identities.
expected_result: bunx-installed pm passes strict merge-driver health and performs semantic Git merges.
actual_result: "Disposable packed Bun consumer passed strict health twice and real item/history Git merge with verified chain; npx and bunx executable checks, linked test, full suite, exact coverage, and static quality pass."
